WEBVTT

00:14.210 --> 00:15.920
<b>FIRE BOLT!</b>

00:36.790 --> 00:38.790
<b>I'm going to kill you.</b>

00:39.540 --> 00:42.630
<b>And then I'm going home with Miss Ryu.</b>

00:45.170 --> 00:46.290
<b>Bring it on.</b>

00:57.750 --> 01:01.630
<b>Is it Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon?  IV</b>

02:17.000 --> 02:21.000
<b>Luvia</b>

02:17.000 --> 02:21.000
<b>Starry Flower</b>

02:31.210 --> 02:32.250
<b>Alise...</b>

02:33.380 --> 02:36.250
<b>It's finally time to join my friends...</b>

02:36.830 --> 02:40.710
<b>They might yell at me, or
throw snarky comments my way...</b>

02:41.330 --> 02:44.210
<b>But in the end, I know they'll
welcome me with open arms.</b>

02:45.330 --> 02:47.170
<b>My dreams are finally coming true.</b>

02:47.170 --> 02:49.040
<b>I'm finally going to atone for my sins.</b>

02:49.960 --> 02:51.380
<b>At last, I get to-</b>

02:51.920 --> 02:52.710
<b>No, it's not.</b>

02:54.420 --> 02:56.000
<b>Don't come any closer, Lion.</b>

02:56.420 --> 02:58.630
<b>Absolutely not. It's out of the question.</b>

02:59.500 --> 03:00.330
<b>Alise...?</b>

03:06.040 --> 03:10.290
<b>Don't you see? If you join us now,
you're going to regret it.</b>

03:11.170 --> 03:13.210
<b>I can't do it anymore...</b>

03:14.130 --> 03:15.670
<b>I'm at my wits' end, Alise.</b>

03:16.710 --> 03:20.710
<b>I can't fight... I can't undo what happened back then.</b>

03:21.500 --> 03:22.460
<b>I'm afraid!</b>

03:22.960 --> 03:27.210
<b>Afraid of facing that creature. Afraid of facing the past...</b>

03:27.710 --> 03:30.080
<b>Which is why I'm ready to-</b>

03:30.670 --> 03:31.380
<b>Liar.</b>

03:32.750 --> 03:35.710
<b>Your justice is screaming at you not to lose that boy.</b>

03:36.210 --> 03:38.460
<b>Your justice is alive and well!</b>

03:38.960 --> 03:41.920
<b>Our Familia sought peace and harmony.</b>

03:42.210 --> 03:43.790
<b>We wanted everyone to be happy!</b>

03:44.460 --> 03:46.630
<b>You never once forgot that.</b>

03:48.710 --> 03:54.130
<b>You always stuck to your guns and did the right thing,
just like I knew you would.</b>

03:55.290 --> 03:56.790
<b>'Cause that's your justice, Lion.</b>

03:57.170 --> 03:58.830
<b>Hope for a brighter future.</b>

03:59.750 --> 04:00.830
<b>Hope...?</b>

04:07.080 --> 04:12.630
<b>You wanted to finish what we started, right?
To make our efforts count for somethin'.</b>

04:12.960 --> 04:15.210
<b>Just think about how many people you helped!</b>

04:15.500 --> 04:17.330
<b>And all the smiles you put on their faces.</b>

04:18.210 --> 04:19.080
<b>You guys...</b>

04:19.670 --> 04:21.420
<b>Justice doesn't have a right answer.</b>

04:21.670 --> 04:24.040
<b>But you came up with an answer of your own.</b>

04:24.040 --> 04:25.790
<b>And it was hope!</b>

04:26.170 --> 04:29.460
<b>Yet you convinced yourself that you'd given up on justice.</b>

04:29.710 --> 04:31.290
<b>How very "Lion" of you.</b>

04:33.630 --> 04:36.540
<b>Get outta here! Don't you have a monster to slay?</b>

04:36.880 --> 04:37.710
<b>Good luck, Lion.</b>

04:37.710 --> 04:39.040
<b>Go kick its ass!</b>

04:37.880 --> 04:38.630
<b>Hang in there.</b>

04:38.330 --> 04:39.830
<b>We'll be rooting for you!</b>

04:38.880 --> 04:40.080
<b>Show it who's boss!</b>

04:41.460 --> 04:45.130
<b>I... I've always wanted to apologize!</b>

04:45.420 --> 04:47.830
<b>I've waited years to tell you how sorry I am!</b>

04:48.170 --> 04:53.250
<b>I've always wanted you to resent me for leaving you
to die, for being powerless to help!</b>

04:53.420 --> 04:57.000
<b>I wanted you to judge me! To attack me! To swear at me!</b>

04:58.290 --> 05:01.920
<b>Oh, that's the problem... I knew it deep down.</b>

05:02.710 --> 05:04.960
<b>You guys wouldn't blame me.</b>

05:06.130 --> 05:08.710
<b>I'm the only one who couldn't forgive myself...</b>

05:09.750 --> 05:13.420
<b>I was only punishing myself because
I thought it might ease the pain somehow...</b>

05:13.920 --> 05:14.750
<b>Lion...</b>

05:16.210 --> 05:20.170
<b>Your justice, the hope in your heart. What's it telling you?</b>

05:22.540 --> 05:24.790
<b>I want... to save him.</b>

05:25.500 --> 05:28.380
<b>I want to go to the tavern with him...</b>

05:28.880 --> 05:30.830
<b>To see Syr and the others again!</b>

05:31.250 --> 05:33.040
<b>Meet it head-on, Lion.</b>

05:34.210 --> 05:35.460
<b>Don't let it get away!</b>

05:38.960 --> 05:40.790
<b>Take care of yourself, Lion.</b>

05:41.500 --> 05:47.880
<b>I'll see you later... my most precious friends in the world.</b>

05:54.580 --> 05:55.290
<b>Bell...</b>

06:39.210 --> 06:43.000
<b>I can't be the Elf from the fairytales,
the one who lived in the lake.</b>

06:43.290 --> 06:45.710
<b>I refuse to depend on a knight in shining armor!</b>

06:46.420 --> 06:49.460
<b>Bell! It's you and me till the bitter end!</b>

06:51.170 --> 06:51.920
<b>Miss Ryu...</b>

06:58.380 --> 06:59.830
<b>I'm going to DESTROY you!</b>

07:14.750 --> 07:18.000
<b>It's slower than before, but I still can't brute force
my way through. If this keeps up, we're-</b>

07:18.000 --> 07:19.920
<b>Now in the skies of the distant forest...</b>

07:21.210 --> 07:24.040
<b>...to the infinite stars mounted upon
the eternal firmament of night!</b>

07:25.460 --> 07:27.380
<b>This fool doth entreat...</b>

07:27.790 --> 07:30.000
<b>...just once for the divine protection of the stars' fire!</b>

07:27.920 --> 07:31.080
<b>I once sentenced a friend to death with this spell...</b>

07:32.210 --> 07:34.880
<b>Grant thy benevolent light to the one who abandoned thee...</b>

07:32.540 --> 07:34.880
<b>But this time is going to be different!</b>

07:35.250 --> 07:37.630
<b>I'm going to protect the people who are precious to me!</b>

07:35.250 --> 07:38.040
<b>Come forth, wandering wind... my fellow drifter!</b>

07:38.500 --> 07:40.710
<b>Miss Ryu only has enough Mind to use her magic once.</b>

07:41.170 --> 07:43.670
<b>So I've got to crack that thing's shell first!</b>

07:44.040 --> 07:45.330
<b>Fire Bolt!</b>

07:57.210 --> 07:59.250
<b>Cross the skies, speed through the wastelands!</b>

08:00.380 --> 08:03.920
<b>Argo... VESTA!</b>

08:22.000 --> 08:26.380
<b>If I had done this back then...
Alise never would have lost!</b>

08:29.920 --> 08:31.380
<b>FIRE BOLT!</b>

08:37.960 --> 08:40.080
<b>Race more swiftly than any other!</b>

08:40.380 --> 08:43.880
<b>Let the light of stardust occupy me and strike my enemy!</b>

08:44.170 --> 08:46.420
<b>LUMINOUS WIND!</b>

09:00.960 --> 09:02.710
<b>It... dodged the attack?</b>

09:03.130 --> 09:04.500
<b>I know about that speed of yours.</b>

09:06.130 --> 09:07.920
<b>I know it better than anyone else!</b>

09:13.790 --> 09:15.130
<b>Neun! Neese!</b>

09:18.580 --> 09:19.830
<b>Asta! Ryana!</b>

09:22.170 --> 09:24.540
<b>Please, guys. Lend me your strength!</b>

09:26.710 --> 09:28.710
<b>Celty! Isuka! Marrue!</b>

09:40.750 --> 09:43.250
<b>I know it's just wishful thinking.</b>

09:43.750 --> 09:47.460
<b>Nothing more than sentiment... A convenient fantasy!</b>

09:47.880 --> 09:48.920
<b>But I don't care!</b>

09:51.330 --> 09:52.330
<b>Kaguya!</b>

10:00.460 --> 10:01.130
<b>Lyla!</b>

10:10.960 --> 10:11.830
<b>Alise...</b>

10:19.460 --> 10:20.250
<b>Goodbye.</b>

10:24.330 --> 10:26.290
<b>LUVIA!</b>

10:41.710 --> 10:42.500
<b>Miss Ryu!</b>

10:44.000 --> 10:46.040
<b>Miss Ryu? Miss Ryu-</b>

10:48.210 --> 10:48.960
<b>Miss Ryu...</b>

10:53.210 --> 10:55.580
<b>I guess... we won...</b>

10:57.080 --> 10:57.880
<b>Yeah...</b>

10:59.380 --> 11:02.920
<b>Now we can... go home...</b>

11:08.790 --> 11:09.710
<b>Bell...</b>

11:11.580 --> 11:14.670
<b>I just... want to say...</b>

11:28.710 --> 11:29.580
<b>Dammit!</b>

11:29.580 --> 11:32.210
<b>Why haven't we found them?
We've looked all over the place!</b>

11:32.210 --> 11:34.290
<b>It's this Floor. It's enormous...</b>

11:34.710 --> 11:36.580
<b>C'mon, where'dja go, Bellcchi?!</b>

11:37.170 --> 11:37.880
<b>Rido!</b>

11:37.960 --> 11:38.710
<b>Rido!</b>

11:40.130 --> 11:40.790
<b>What's wrong?</b>

11:41.000 --> 11:43.040
<b>I heard voices! Bell and his friend!</b>

11:43.040 --> 11:43.710
<b>You did?!</b>

11:43.710 --> 11:45.040
<b>Hurry, follow me!</b>

11:54.080 --> 11:55.250
<b>Is this the place, Wiene?</b>

12:00.210 --> 12:01.000
<b>Bell!</b>

12:06.460 --> 12:07.960
<b>Bell... Bell!</b>

12:10.210 --> 12:12.250
<b>Don't worry, he's still breathing.</b>

12:13.750 --> 12:15.210
<b>The Elf's alive, too.</b>

12:15.630 --> 12:18.040
<b>Let, notify Lilicchi and the others ASAP.</b>

12:18.040 --> 12:18.710
<b>Got it!</b>

12:21.080 --> 12:22.210
<b>Here, give him one of these.</b>

12:22.630 --> 12:24.040
<b>I got 'em from Marie.</b>

12:24.460 --> 12:25.080
<b>'Kay!</b>

12:26.080 --> 12:27.710
<b>Gross, give her the other one.</b>

12:42.000 --> 12:43.540
<b>Wiene...?</b>

12:44.130 --> 12:45.000
<b>Bell!</b>

12:49.080 --> 12:52.750
<b>Master Bell?! Master Bell!</b>

12:52.750 --> 12:54.580
<b>Ryu! Where are you?!</b>

12:54.750 --> 12:56.420
<b>Meow if you can hear us!</b>

12:56.630 --> 12:59.460
<b>Time to go. We'd better let Fels know.</b>

13:00.580 --> 13:01.330
<b>Yeah...</b>

13:04.000 --> 13:06.500
<b>Quickly. Let the surface-dwellers handle the rest.</b>

13:08.250 --> 13:09.960
<b>You'll see him again soon.</b>

13:11.460 --> 13:12.170
<b>'Kay...</b>

13:23.880 --> 13:24.790
<b>Master Bell!</b>

14:03.380 --> 14:04.130
<b>Ryu?</b>

14:06.000 --> 14:08.420
<b>Thank goodness. What a relief...</b>

14:08.750 --> 14:09.920
<b>Syr...</b>

14:10.420 --> 14:13.880
<b>Look! She's up from her little cat nap!</b>

14:13.880 --> 14:16.170
<b>We thought we lost you for a second there...</b>

14:16.420 --> 14:18.420
<b>I didn't know it was pawssible to sleep for three days.</b>

14:18.420 --> 14:19.920
<b>Color me impressed!</b>

14:21.710 --> 14:22.960
<b>Three days...?</b>

14:23.250 --> 14:27.960
<b>Carrying an unconscious Elf to the surface
from the 37th Floor wasn't easy, y'know.</b>

14:27.960 --> 14:30.960
<b>And then we brought you here,
to the infirmary inside Babel.</b>

14:31.210 --> 14:33.170
<b>Looks like you're feline better!</b>

14:36.080 --> 14:37.540
<b>Where is he? Where's Bell?!</b>

14:37.540 --> 14:38.960
<b>C-calm down, Ryu!</b>

14:38.960 --> 14:40.670
<b>There's no need to worry about Mr. Bell.</b>

14:40.880 --> 14:43.580
<b>Yup, that's right! Mr. White Hair's purrfectly fine.</b>

14:43.580 --> 14:47.380
<b>They've got him in a room down the hall,
so you can relax-</b>

14:49.130 --> 14:50.960
<b>Wait a minute, Ryu! You're wearing a-</b>

14:51.080 --> 14:51.960
<b>Ryu!</b>

14:54.290 --> 14:54.880
<b>Huh?!</b>

14:56.670 --> 14:57.330
<b>Bell...</b>

14:59.130 --> 15:00.630
<b>Bell... Bell...</b>

15:03.250 --> 15:03.960
<b>Bell!</b>

15:08.920 --> 15:09.540
<b>Bell...</b>

15:10.040 --> 15:11.750
<b>M-Miss Ryu...</b>

15:13.080 --> 15:14.830
<b>Uh, Miss Elf...</b>

15:15.420 --> 15:16.630
<b>Your, uh, outfit...</b>

15:18.210 --> 15:19.080
<b>Huh?</b>

15:41.330 --> 15:43.040
<b>His injuries are SEVERE!</b>

15:43.500 --> 15:45.750
<b>Who the hell slaps a patient while he's in the hospital?!</b>

15:46.210 --> 15:47.290
<b>Sorry...</b>

15:51.960 --> 15:53.540
<b>Approximately four days total.</b>

15:54.040 --> 15:56.830
<b>That's how long you and Miss Elf
spent in the Deep Floors.</b>

15:57.500 --> 15:59.130
<b>I heard it from Ouranos.</b>

16:00.710 --> 16:02.210
<b>Four days...</b>

16:03.500 --> 16:04.380
<b>Yeah.</b>

16:04.920 --> 16:08.830
<b>With so few party members, the odds were
stacked against them in the Floor Boss fight...</b>

16:09.290 --> 16:11.960
<b>But they did an incredible job. You all did.</b>

16:12.670 --> 16:18.830
<b>I owe it all to Miss Ryu. Her wisdom and knowledge
of how to survive on the Deep Floors came in handy.</b>

16:19.630 --> 16:21.710
<b>In fact, if she hadn't been there, I...</b>

16:22.250 --> 16:25.040
<b>There's a good chance I never would've made it home.</b>

16:25.460 --> 16:31.000
<b>I don't doubt it. To tell you the truth,
I nearly passed out when I heard the details...</b>

16:32.670 --> 16:34.750
<b>I suppose I ought to be grateful.</b>

16:35.500 --> 16:38.080
<b>That a champion of justice was around to save you.</b>

16:40.210 --> 16:41.130
<b>Yeah...</b>

16:42.040 --> 16:47.040
<b>Seriously, we can't thank you
enough for rescuing Master Bell.</b>

16:48.540 --> 16:49.460
<b>You've got it backwards.</b>

16:49.460 --> 16:50.130
<b>Huh?</b>

16:51.670 --> 16:56.880
<b>If it weren't for him... I would have resigned
myself to death a long time ago.</b>

16:57.290 --> 17:02.580
<b>My friends decided to sacrifice their lives,
and I couldn't do anything to stop them.</b>

17:03.630 --> 17:05.580
<b>But he was different.</b>

17:06.380 --> 17:08.750
<b>He gave me the strength to keep going.</b>

17:09.710 --> 17:13.750
<b>Plus, I should be the one thanking you.</b>

17:15.420 --> 17:22.130
<b>You took a huge risk traveling all the way down into
the Deep Floors. Because of you, we made it out alive.</b>

17:23.290 --> 17:25.420
<b>Words can't express how grateful I am.</b>

17:28.580 --> 17:30.250
<b>Well, we couldn't have done it on our own.</b>

17:31.500 --> 17:35.790
<b>The Xenos, Tsubaki, your waitress pals...</b>

17:36.330 --> 17:39.790
<b>Without all those guys around,
we would've been screwed.</b>

17:42.130 --> 17:43.250
<b>Speaking of which...</b>

17:44.210 --> 17:48.210
<b>Rumor has it that the fugitive Gale Wind met her demise.</b>

17:50.460 --> 17:51.540
<b>I'm tellin' ya!</b>

17:52.330 --> 17:54.380
<b>Those assholes were responsible for ALL of it!</b>

17:54.750 --> 17:59.960
<b>A bunch of stragglers from the Rudra Familia.
They're the ones who caused this whole mess!</b>

18:00.540 --> 18:02.670
<b>And when Gale Wind showed up, she...</b>

18:05.130 --> 18:09.040
<b>She protected us... Took 'em on alone
like a bona fide hero!</b>

18:09.580 --> 18:12.790
<b>She slaughtered the bastards,
but her wounds were fatal...</b>

18:14.210 --> 18:14.960
<b>Now!</b>

18:15.580 --> 18:17.580
<b>It's time we discuss payment options.</b>

18:18.000 --> 18:20.540
<b>I'm thinking half the bounty on Gale Wind's head!</b>

18:20.960 --> 18:24.920
<b>Why, I'd even accept a third.
So I'll just be takin' the cash and...</b>

18:28.460 --> 18:34.500
<b>Given that Master Bors is the head of Rivira, and given
that none of the other adventurers raised any objections,</b>

18:34.500 --> 18:37.380
<b>it seems as though the Guild has
acknowledged Gale Wind's death.</b>

18:39.580 --> 18:45.540
<b>Someone in Rivira let it slip that Gale Wind was also
the mysterious adventurer who helped defeat the Goliath.</b>

18:46.420 --> 18:49.460
<b>I hear she's bein' hailed as a "defender of justice."</b>

18:58.960 --> 18:59.830
<b>G'morning!</b>

19:01.040 --> 19:02.250
<b>Good morning.</b>

19:02.670 --> 19:03.920
<b>Are you feeling any better?</b>

19:03.920 --> 19:05.710
<b>Yes, I'm all back to normal.</b>

19:05.710 --> 19:06.830
<b>Glad to hear it.</b>

19:09.380 --> 19:11.130
<b>How are Anya and the others?</b>

19:11.630 --> 19:14.290
<b>I haven't seen them since the day I woke up.</b>

19:14.630 --> 19:20.040
<b>Uh, well... They spent quite a bit of time in
the Dungeon when they went searching for you.</b>

19:20.750 --> 19:25.790
<b>Mama Mia had a few choice words for them.
It might be a while before they get a day off from work...</b>

19:26.500 --> 19:28.040
<b>Choice words...?</b>

19:28.170 --> 19:29.630
<b>Yeah, she wasn't happy.</b>

19:30.420 --> 19:33.130
<b>Oh, Mama Mia asked me to deliver a message.</b>

19:33.540 --> 19:35.540
<b>Wh-what is it?</b>

19:36.830 --> 19:43.130
<b>"I made too much risotto, so hurry on home
and eat the leftovers for me," she said.</b>

19:48.790 --> 19:49.540
<b>I will.</b>

19:58.250 --> 19:59.130
<b>Miss Ryu!</b>

20:01.960 --> 20:02.670
<b>Bell!</b>

20:06.580 --> 20:07.830
<b>Sorry to keep you waiting.</b>

20:08.250 --> 20:10.750
<b>It's okay. I just got here, myself.</b>

20:11.040 --> 20:14.290
<b>Lucky us, right? Getting discharged
from the hospital on the same day.</b>

20:19.380 --> 20:20.500
<b>Your outfit...</b>

20:22.290 --> 20:24.250
<b>D-does it look weird?</b>

20:25.000 --> 20:27.290
<b>Not at all. I think it looks nice on you!</b>

20:29.460 --> 20:33.040
<b>I-I borrowed it from Syr, and she's got good taste, so...</b>

20:35.710 --> 20:41.960
<b>Well, it's been a while since we've gotten
to enjoy the sunshine. Should we go for a walk?</b>

20:45.380 --> 20:48.000
<b>Bell, is your left arm going to be okay?</b>

20:48.790 --> 20:52.380
<b>You suffered some serious damage,
and magic can only do so much...</b>

20:52.380 --> 20:56.210
<b>Thanks to Miss Amid, I've got
my full range of motion back.</b>

20:56.630 --> 21:00.000
<b>Apparently, they didn't fix it so much
as rebuild it from scratch.</b>

21:00.420 --> 21:01.790
<b>They rebuilt it?</b>

21:02.040 --> 21:04.210
<b>The tissues were torn and the bones were shattered.</b>

21:04.210 --> 21:07.500
<b>But they said it's a good thing I kept
all the parts wrapped up in my scarf.</b>

21:07.960 --> 21:09.750
<b>They can do that kind of thing?</b>

21:10.540 --> 21:11.710
<b>Yeah, I guess so.</b>

21:12.250 --> 21:14.540
<b>Although I'm told it was a very expensive procedure.</b>

21:20.290 --> 21:21.880
<b>I never knew this place was here.</b>

21:22.500 --> 21:25.960
<b>Yeah... Alise and I used to come here together.</b>

21:29.080 --> 21:30.630
<b>"You should give up on justice."</b>

21:32.460 --> 21:37.130
<b>That's exactly what Lady Astrea said to me when
I had become obsessed with getting revenge.</b>

21:38.080 --> 21:43.670
<b>I interpreted it as rejection. I was convinced
I'd been excommunicated by my goddess.</b>

21:44.580 --> 21:45.920
<b>But I was wrong...</b>

21:47.330 --> 21:51.920
<b>Lady Astrea said that to save me.
She chose her words carefully.</b>

21:53.080 --> 21:58.460
<b>Because she realized that I would've fallen apart at the
seams if she had stopped me from going down that path.</b>

22:00.540 --> 22:02.960
<b>I owe it all to you, Bell.</b>

22:02.960 --> 22:03.670
<b>Huh?</b>

22:05.170 --> 22:08.830
<b>You told me I still had justice in me.</b>

22:10.290 --> 22:14.290
<b>It was your words that helped me rise to my feet again.</b>

22:15.040 --> 22:16.000
<b>Miss Ryu...</b>

22:17.330 --> 22:18.880
<b>I've said it before, but...</b>

22:20.670 --> 22:23.540
<b>You're a Human who's worthy of respect.</b>

22:25.290 --> 22:27.460
<b>Thank you, Bell.</b>

22:28.380 --> 22:29.580
<b>Oh, wow.</b>

22:31.170 --> 22:33.670
<b>I'm so glad you're finally smiling from the heart.</b>

22:34.790 --> 22:37.710
<b>You look beautiful. More beautiful than ever before.</b>

22:43.670 --> 22:44.290
<b>Huh?</b>

22:47.170 --> 22:48.040
<b>Miss Ryu...?</b>

22:49.580 --> 22:53.330
<b>I-I can't look you in the eye...</b>

22:53.330 --> 22:55.210
<b>H-how come?</b>

22:56.290 --> 22:57.380
<b>I don't know...</b>

22:57.920 --> 22:59.670
<b>I-I've gotta go!</b>

23:00.830 --> 23:01.750
<b>M-Miss Ryu...!</b>

23:10.290 --> 23:11.830
<b>I-I don't understand...</b>

23:14.790 --> 23:19.670
<b>Oh, Alise... What in the world am I supposed to do...?</b>

23:33.880 --> 23:35.080
<b>Don't let him get away.</b>
